{"id": "53526", "title": "表哥的糜烂生活", "author": "平方", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 20, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/53/53526.htm", "intro": "这篇是《午安，女王！》的番外罗冠表哥的\r\n\r\n\r\n　　“痛！痛！啊啊啊！你……慢点！”\r\n\r\n\r\n　　“嗯……你缠得这么紧，怎么慢！”\r\n\r\n\r\n　　“不管，不管！慢……慢点……慢点……啊！啊！”\r\n\r\n\r\n　　床上的人尖声的叫着，古铜色的小腿紧紧缠住身上人的腰肢不放。\r\n\r\n\r\n　　“小冠，别叫了！”身上那人又是狠命的一番抽插，一下快似一下，简直要把罗冠的软穴磨出火来。\r\n\r\n\r\n　　到最后，高亢的叫喊走了调，变成了零零碎碎地呜咽。罗冠在波浪里颠簸起伏，咿咿呀呀的不知云里雾里，全身上下只有后面那个地方灼人的紧。腰几乎折成两段，那个人还死命的往立面戳，最要紧的是戳的他一边痛还一边舒服", "base": "files/article/html/53/53526", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "7503755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2-3章", "file": "7503758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章", "file": "7503760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "7503762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "7503763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章", "file": "7503766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "7503770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章", "file": "7503771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "7503773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "7503775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "7503776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12.5章", "file": "7503777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "7503779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "7503780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "7503783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "7503785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "7503788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "7503789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "7503791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "7503795.html", "available": false}]}